{"headword":"עָנָו","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"(?; Lag<sup>BN 48</sup>) <strong>n.m. poor, afflicted, humble, meek</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">עָנָו</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:3\" href=\"/Numbers.12.3\">Nu 12:3</a> (Kt; Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנָיו</span> is to ensure the—ָ according to Di Kö<sup>ii 1, 76</sup>); elsewhere pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָוִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.19\">Is 29:19</a> + 11 times + Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָוִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.7\">Is 32:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:19\" href=\"/Psalms.9.19\">ψ 9:19</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנִיִּים</span>); Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָוִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:13\" href=\"/Psalms.9.13\">ψ 9:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:12\" href=\"/Psalms.10.12\">10:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.34\">Pr 3:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.21\">14:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.19\">16:19</a> (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עניים</span>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַנְוֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.3\">Zp 2:3</a> + 2 times, + Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">ענוי</span> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנִיֵּי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:4\" href=\"/Amos.8.4\">Am 8:4</a> (so <a data-ref=\"Job 24:4\" href=\"/Job.24.4\">Jb 24:4</a> van d. H.; but <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנִיֵּי</span> Kt and Qr Baer Ginsb)—these forms shew confusion with <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>, which is perhaps only another form of <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנָו</span> (otherwise Rahlfs<sup>op. cit. 62 f.</sup> Dr<sup>‘Poor’</sup> in Hastings<sup>DB</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנָו</span> = <em>humble, meek</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span> = pass. <em>humbled, afflicted</em>);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>poor, needy</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.21\">Pr 14:21</a> (Qr)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>poor and weak</em>, oppressed by rich and powerful <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:7\" href=\"/Amos.2.7\">Am 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.19\">Is 29:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.7\">32:7</a> (Kt); <span dir=\"rtl\">ענוי (ה)ארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:10\" href=\"/Psalms.76.10\">ψ 76:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.4\">Is 11:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.3\">Zp 2:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:4\" href=\"/Amos.8.4\">Am 8:4</a> (Kt), <a data-ref=\"Job 24:4\" href=\"/Job.24.4\">Jb 24:4</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>poor, weak and afflicted</em> Israel (usually rendered <em>meek</em>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:17\" href=\"/Psalms.10.17\">ψ 10:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:26\" href=\"/Psalms.22.26\">22:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:9\" href=\"/Psalms.25.9\">25:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:3\" href=\"/Psalms.34.3\">34:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:11\" href=\"/Psalms.37.11\">37:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:33\" href=\"/Psalms.69.33\">69:33</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span> <strong>3</strong>, also in all these ψψ), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:6\" href=\"/Psalms.147.6\">147:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:4\" href=\"/Psalms.149.4\">149:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.1\">Is 61:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁברי לב</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.2\">66:2</a> <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָנִי\" href=\"/BDB,_עָנִי\", dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</a> <strong>3</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:19\" href=\"/Psalms.9.19\">ψ 9:19</a> (Kt) v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:13\" href=\"/Psalms.9.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:12\" href=\"/Psalms.10.12\">10:12</a> (Qr)."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>humble, lowly, meek</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:3\" href=\"/Numbers.12.3\">Nu 12:3</a> (Moses); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.34\">Pr 3:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.19\">16:19</a> (both Qr)."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB07450","strong_numbers":["6035"],"next_hw":"עֲנָוָה","prev_hw":"עָנָה³","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["6705"],"TWOT":["1652a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}